  "sourceTitle": "Wasabi Mousse",
  "sourceText": "Wasabi Mousse\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, February 14, 2010 - 9:09am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nteaspoon Wasabi powder\ncup Heavy cream\nSalt to taste\nLemon juice to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a medium bowl, whisk the wasabi powder into the heavy cream. Lightly season with salt and drops of lemon juice. Whisk until mixture is stiff. 2 This recipe yields 1/2 cup of mousse.",
